          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "人生の暮れに差し掛かり、彼はこれまでの歩みを静かに振り返る時間が増えた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "秋の暮れを感じさせる冷たい風が、公園の落ち葉を舞い上げている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "華やかだったお祭りも暮れに近づき、祭囃子がどこか寂しげに響いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "year-end",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "押し迫った暮れの忙しさを忘れるために、家族で温泉旅行に出かけた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "暮れの商店街は、正月用品を買い求める人々でいつにも増して活気づいている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "お世話になった方々へ、暮れの挨拶を兼ねてお歳暮を贈る準備を始めた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
